Output docs/comp/final-defense-media/videos/p08-kb-citation.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set FontSize 25
Set LetterSpacing 0
Set LineHeight 1.05
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 4ms
Type "cd docs/comp/final-defense-media"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+L
Type "sed -n '1,22p' transcripts/p08-kb-citation.txt"
Enter
Sleep 12s
